    "title": "GATEWAY-development-commerce-platform-api-Create Api Inventory Adjust-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Inventory Adjustment API enables businesses to modify inventory levels for specific items in their commerce platform. This endpoint facilitates adjustments by accepting requests that specify the inventory ID and the type of adjustment needed. Typical consumers include inventory managers and fulfillment teams who require accurate stock levels to ensure seamless operations. Use cases involve correcting stock discrepancies, updating inventory quantities after stock counts, or reflecting changes due to returns or damages. This API streamlines inventory management processes for a more efficient commerce environment.",
